{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本男星坂口健太郎主演日、韓、港合資製作的重頭劇《kiDnap GAME》，開播後以來收視低迷。</p><p>雖然該劇每集製作費高達1億日圓(約500萬港元)，直迫日劇天王堺雅人主演的話題人氣劇《VIVANT》，但收視卻只得對方的4分一，上周播出的第3集</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:20:55.478919+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T15:03:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T15:18:15.792178+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:18:15.792178+00:00","content_hash":"3fcf814efa58c80b50a7931a2f222ae0f4d7df901df156256f32f04fe66ba5fa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}